  "type": "Section",
  "number": "1.1",
  "title": "Welcome",
  "body": " Welcome  This book is written for you — a Junior Cycle mathematics student in Ireland. It brings the NCCA curriculum to life in an interactive, online format. You'll work through five mathematical strands: Geometry , Number , Algebra , and Statistics . Throughout, you'll apply cross-cutting skills in the Unifying Strand — problem-solving, reasoning, representation, and communication that tie everything together.  "
